    "sections": {
        "description": "SPA and Wellness Centre Theme is designed with layouts for presenting wellness services, treatment information, and business details in a clear website structure. It includes customizable sections that can be used for service descriptions, image galleries, pricing, appointment information, contact details, and other relevant content. The responsive layout adjusts website elements across different screen sizes, helping maintain consistent navigation on desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. Typography, colors, menus, and page sections can be customized to align the website with an established visual identity. The SPA and Wellness Centre Theme can present information about spa and wellness centres through dedicated service and treatment sections. Content layouts can also describe programs offered by health and wellness clinics, including treatment details, schedules, and appointment procedures. Additional page sections can be adapted for yoga studios or meditation centres to display class schedules, instructor information, and program details. Fitness and wellness centres can use structured layouts for describing facilities, memberships, activities, and operating information. The overall design focuses on organizing service-related content into accessible sections without relying on complex page structures."
    },
